each file carries the ASF header. The Rust code in
crates/odradek-protocol/src/messages/ is generated from them.

Apache License 2.0 section 4(d) requires a redistribution to carry the
attribution notices from the upstream NOTICE that pertain to the part
being redistributed. Apache Kafka's NOTICE also covers jersey, jqwik,
streams-scala, and code taken from Apache Hive; none of those appear in
